From f6132a5bf605e2df1e580bf6d24dbc484af2036d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: beau4201 <beau.ten.berge@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:28:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] telephony: answer an app with a persona with the cells of its place

getAllCellInfo, requestCellInfoUpdate and getCellLocation return the cells of the place of an app that has a persona (the persona file of the system server, the cells of the image); its service state and network scan carry no location information of the real radio. ADR-208.
